# Skia (m144, e2e66233743d) built for Windows with mingw-w64 (llvm-mingw) instead
# of MSVC: GN learns is_mingw/is_msvc, and every MSVC-only setting (cl.exe
# flags, the msvc toolchain, the Visual Studio lookup) is is_msvc's alone.
# Applied by tools/skia/build-windows.sh. The approach follows MSYS2's
# mingw-w64-skia patches (github.com/msys2/MINGW-packages, BSD-3-Clause),
# redone for this Skia revision and for cross-compiling from Linux.

